# Keys this project pulls from the dd-env vault.
# Publishing only — nothing here is needed to build, test or run the scorer.

# npmjs.org automation token, read+write on @dariodario/*. This package lives on
# PUBLIC npm, not GitHub Packages: the GH token that resolves @dariodario-com/*
# elsewhere in the workspace cannot publish it. Consumed by .npmrc via env
# expansion, so the value never touches a file on disk.
NPM_TOKEN
